      "abstract": "Proctored randomised experiment with 211 undergraduates who studied an unfamiliar topic and wrote an essay with or without AI. AI access raised immediate test scores by 7.2 points (0.28 SD), and a 3.9-point gain remained a week later. Gains lasted for students who used AI to explain and tutor, and faded for those who let it write.",
